# Local output directory for generated documents, left over from the removed
# filesystem-backed ObjectStore. Root-anchored and slash-terminated on purpose:
# an unanchored "storage" (or "/storage") also matches the Java package
# src/main/java/com/click4bonds/app/Modules/Storage/ on a case-insensitive
# checkout, which silently hides new source files from git status.
# Do not drop the leading slash.
/storage/
